    "revid": 1336221891,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><i><b>UFC 249: Ferguson vs. Gaethje</b></i> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Mixed_martial_arts\" title=\"Mixed martial arts\">mixed martial arts</a> event produced by the <a href=\"/wiki/Ultimate_Fighting_Championship\" title=\"Ultimate Fighting Championship\">Ultimate Fighting Championship</a> that took place on May 9, 2020 at <a href=\"/wiki/VyStar_Veterans_Memorial_Arena\" title=\"VyStar Veterans Memorial Arena\">VyStar Veterans Memorial Arena</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Jacksonville,_Florida\" title=\"Jacksonville, Florida\">Jacksonville, Florida</a>, United States.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-NewUFC249_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NewUFC249-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Florida_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Florida-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Jacksonville_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Jacksonville-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was originally planned to take place on April 18 at <a href=\"/wiki/Barclays_Center\" title=\"Barclays Center\">Barclays Center</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Brooklyn\" title=\"Brooklyn\">Brooklyn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/New_York_(state)\" title=\"New York (state)\">New York</a>, United States.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UFC249_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UFC249-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Due to the <a href=\"/wiki/COVID-19_pandemic\" title=\"COVID-19 pandemic\">COVID-19 pandemic</a>, the event was eventually postponed <i>(see section below)</i>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Postponed_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Postponed-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> On April 21, the UFC confirmed that UFC 249 would be moved to May 9 and take place in <a href=\"/wiki/Florida\" title=\"Florida\">Florida</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-NewUFC249_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NewUFC249-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Florida_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Florida-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p></div>"
  }
}
